d addressing them organically in  this week's episode things like what's  gonna happen to nasa if everyone goes  over to helios and i guess you don't  really need to introduce everyone who's  gonna be on sojourner if two of them are  gonna die right away and that is a nice  bonus that we'll get a little more of  the russian side of things when we bring  these two groups together and i'm  curious to see how they influence each  other while they're working together  this was a pretty fantastic ed episode  if you think about it it really pulled  on all the things that we know about the  character and how he'll react to  different situations to build up a  situation where we aren't a hundred  percent on what he'll do next i really  don't know where they're going with some  of the clean energy stuff and the jimmy  gets involved with conspiracy theory  people  sides of the story i think it's a little  early to tell like i said before i think  there is some interesting stuff they  could do here but i don't think any of  that is working great yet at the same  time it's a little early to tell so  we'll see how that develops i'm looking  forward to next week hopefully they can  keep it up and i think that's a good  place to leave things let me know in the  comments what you're thinking about the  race how it's playing out and what  you're hoping to see in the upcoming  episodes  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already and thanks for watching  i'll talk to you soon

